# Do not touch protected core

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` (dispatch/subscribe engine) and `app/src/types.ts` (domain
shapes and Action union) are load-bearing files. Changes here should be
additive and done with explicit approval.

## Rule

- Never rewrite or refactor `app/src/store.ts`.
- Make only small, additive changes to `app/src/types.ts` (e.g., add new
  Action variants or optional fields) following the golden path.
- If editing these files is necessary, provide a clear explanation and get
  approval.

## How to verify

1. Any PR touching either file should include an explicit justification.
2. `alwaysApply: true` means assistants should enforce this rule by default.